    "## 13. Equipment utilization at the operating point\n",
    "\n",
    "The nearest calculated pressure case is rerun at the interpolated operating rate. This\n",
    "makes the bottleneck and all utilization terms visible rather than reporting only a\n",
    "maximum-rate number."
   ]
  },
  {
